# The №847 ledger golden (the №832 w1_attest anchor form): the ORDERED
# action sequence the capability-trace run must journal — issue → use →
# revoke → deny (the full typed trace of the capability contract,
# ADR-0203 §2). One action per line; the run's trail may carry
# additional ACTION-path records between them (write/read are journaled
# too), but the capability lifecycle must appear in exactly this order.
grant.issued
grant.used
grant.revoked
deny.IRREVERSIBLE_NO_GRANT
